===Prefix===
{{head|mk|prefix}}

# [[too]], [[overly]], [[excessively]]
#:''голем''
#:''преголем''
#::''big''
#::''too big''
# [[re-]], [[again]]
#:''прати''
#:''препрати''
#::''to send''
#::''to resend, forward''
# [[across]], [[over]], [[through]]
#:''качи''
#:''прекачи''
