==Russian==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{etyl|cu|ru}} {{m|cu|пре-}}, {{m|cu|прѣ-}}, from {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*per-}}. Compare native {{m|ru|пере-}}.

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|tr=pre-}}

# {{context|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[over]], [[across]]
